  "qualification": [
    "Two independent projected views; perspective elevation and geometry are source-led redraws, not exact mesh cameras.",
    "Far launcher hardware is reused at smaller depth scale behind rigid hull; separate far launcher generation failed review and remains unused.",
    "Tail boom and original terminal tail remain one rigid hull source, additional tail drawing not used to avoid duplicate fin.",
    "Rotor rotates through four real horizontal-plane native snapshots, never screen-plane spinning blade strips.",
    "All movable equipment is parented to rigid fuselage; every destruction group uses its real attached snapshot in renderer supporting snapshots.",
    "All motion/destruction is original CQC presentation adaptation, no changes to combat data, HP, saves or clocks."
  ],
